# @end expo-cli
# Firebase. google-services.json is deliberately NOT ignored: it ships inside
# every APK and is extractable from any published build, so it isn't a secret,
# and EAS builds from the git archive — ignoring it means the build has no
# Firebase config and push notifications silently break.
#
# The service-account key is a different matter entirely. That one grants send
# rights on the project and must never be committed.
GoogleService-Info.plist
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
